B.QA=s(['EDUZA ("the Platform") is a school-management and results-reporting tool developed and operated by Mo2IT Incorporations ("we", "us", "the Provider"). The Platform is provided to registered schools ("the School", "you") as a tool to help capture, manage, and communicate learner data, including marks and report cards. The Provider does not create, verify, moderate, or endorse any academic results, marks, or content entered into the Platform by a School\'s own staff.'],t.s)
B.a8j=new A.i0("1. What EDUZA Is",B.QA,B.a_)
B.Rl=s(["All marks, results, learner records, and report card content are captured and uploaded by the School's own teachers and administrators. The School is solely responsible for:"],t.s)
B.RI=s(["Verifying that marks and results uploaded by its teachers are accurate before publishing them","Ensuring only authorised staff have access to capture or publish results","Reviewing report cards before release to learners and parents","Correcting and re-publishing any results found to be inaccurate after release"],t.s)
B.a8r=new A.i0("2. Responsibility for Data Accuracy",B.Rl,B.RI)
B.RP=s(['The Platform is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind, whether express, implied, or statutory, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, accuracy, or non-infringement. We do not warrant that the Platform will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of data loss, and we do not warrant the accuracy or completeness of any content entered by Schools, teachers, or learners.'],t.s)
B.a8q=new A.i0("3. No Warranty",B.RP,B.a_)
B.PT=s(["To the fullest extent permitted by law, Mo2IT Incorporations and its directors, employees, and agents will not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, exemplary, or punitive damages, or for any loss of data, revenue, goodwill, or academic/reputational harm, arising out of or relating to:"],t.s)
B.QH=s(["Marks, results, or report cards entered, edited, published, or withheld by a School or its staff","Any dispute between a School and a learner, parent, guardian, or third party regarding results","Delays, interruptions, or errors in the availability of the Platform","Unauthorised access to an account caused by a School's failure to safeguard its own login credentials"],t.s)
B.a8p=new A.i0("4. Limitation of Liability",B.PT,B.QH)
B.Rg=s(["Each School using the Platform agrees to indemnify and hold harmless Mo2IT Incorporations from and against any claims, damages, losses, or expenses (including reasonable legal fees) arising from:"],t.s)
B.Qy=s(["Results or report cards published by that School, including any dispute over their accuracy","That School's breach of applicable education, data-protection, or privacy laws","Misuse of the Platform by that School's staff, learners, or other authorised users"],t.s)
B.a8l=new A.i0("5. Indemnity",B.Rg,B.Qy)
B.Qx=s(["Learner and staff personal information captured on the Platform is processed on behalf of the School, which acts as the responsible party under the Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA). Mo2IT Incorporations acts as an operator, processing data only in accordance with the School's instructions and for the purpose of providing the Platform. Schools remain responsible for obtaining any consents required from parents, guardians, or learners for the processing of their information."],t.s)
B.a8o=new A.i0("6. Personal Information & POPIA",B.Qx,B.a_)
B.Qa=s(["We may update this Privacy Policy & Disclaimer from time to time. Continued use of the Platform after an update constitutes acceptance of the revised terms."],t.s)
B.a8n=new A.i0("7. Changes to This Policy",B.Qa,B.a_)
B.RE=s(["The EDUZA mobile app is a companion learner portal to the web Platform. It signs you in using the Admission Number and ID Number your school issued you, and displays only the data your school has captured for your own profile \u2014 report cards, subject marks, past papers, announcements, and messages addressed to you.","To provide its features, the app requests the following on-device permissions and storage, each of which you can decline or change afterwards in your device settings:"],t.s)
B.Q_=s(["Notifications \u2014 to alert you to new messages and announcements. You can turn this off any time in the app's Settings screen.","Downloads / file storage \u2014 used only when you choose to open a past exam paper, so it can be saved to your device and opened in your PDF viewer of choice.","A small amount of data is also kept locally on your device (not sent to us) purely for convenience: your appearance theme, text size, whether you chose to stay signed in, and downloaded past paper files."],t.s)
B.a8m=new A.i0("8. The EDUZA Mobile App",B.RE,B.Q_)
B.Rn=s(["Questions about this policy can be directed to Mo2IT Incorporations through your school's usual support channel."],t.s)
